WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:03.737
PHOTOGRAPHERS:
(SHOUTING) Mira! Mira! Mira!

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:06.739
I'm so sick of being
the superhero.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.075
But blockbusters just
let you make movies you love.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.709
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:12.144
MIRA:<i> I'll be Irma Vep.</i>

00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:14.213
This is the part
she's been dying to play.

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:15.915
<i> I told her not to get involved
 with those people.</i>

00:00:16.015 --> 00:00:17.217
<i> What else can I do?</i>

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:21.054
How's it been going?
You happy?

00:00:21.154 --> 00:00:23.556
Mira, I'm never happy.

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.859
Who would have thought that you
would end up working with him?

00:00:26.959 --> 00:00:27.960
(PAINED GROAN)

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.663
René's process can be confusing.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:34.267 line:0%
(SPEAKING IN FRENCH)

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.868
(GRUNTING)

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:38.004
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.573
You're a stranger
in a strange town.

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.244
You play tough,
but you're so candid.

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:48.214
I'm young,
I'm a movie star.

00:00:48.314 --> 00:00:50.283
I like when they look at you.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.285
MIRA:<i> What matters
 is staying sane.</i>

00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:56.389
♪ (MUSIC SWELLS) ♪

